      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "George Montgomery (born George Montgomery Letz, August 29, 1916 – December 12, 2000) was an American actor, painter, sculptor, furniture craftsman, and stuntman who is best known as an actor in Western film and television.",
